// PowerShell AMSI Bypass Strings
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_powershell_amsi_bypass.yml (a91464d8-ed60-4ee1-b654-791defd2714c)
// Level: high. ATT&CK: T1685 Disable or Modify Tools
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"1") and (process.command_line like~ ("*AmsiUtils*", "*amsiInitFailed*", "*AmsiScanBuffer*", "*amsiContext*"))
